    390  f1b9							; frame return). Any SELECT/RESET press (level-triggered, prev-released via
    391  f1b9							; StepsLeft): DropTarget=$FF (old title) + jsr DropArm (.DATitle pose/score
    392  f1b9							; — the room is ALREADY loaded from boot LoadLevel, no deep LoadLevel:
    393  f1b9							; stack depth DropStep→TitleIntro→DropArm keeps sim_bomb_fuse min-SP).
