    395  f1b9							; RefreshEnemyY's idle-only guard never touches it during gameplay... its
    396  f1b9							; gameplay latch writes StepsLeft only when DropTarget==0 — intro frames
    397  f1b9							; have DropTarget=$FD so ownership stays clean).
