    527  f395		       4c f8 fb 	      jmp	ReturnPad
    528  f398
    529  f398							; MelApply: A = note code. Starts the Lead at that pitch, or silences AUD0 on
    530  f398							; a rest ($3E). $3F (loop) HOLDS the tone the load frame started - the old
    531  f398							; paired player's `cmp #$FF / beq .MelDone` arm, kept for an identical melody.
