    745  f560							;  ALIAS of TallyTicks — banner = gameplay entry only,
    746  f560							;  tally = level-exit bonus; LoadLevel gates on $FD)
    747  f560							; $F6 is NOT ScoreOn — bank0 uses it as BombX. Do not write $F6 here.
