    851  f584							; --- Respawn hover (user rule 2026-10-21) ------------------------------
    852  f584							; $FF = armed at death (kernel LoseLife): an untouched player keeps
    853  f584							; hovering. The FIRST direction/fire press starts the 1.5 s grace, which
    854  f584							; then expires on its own so a sideways-only player still falls. Frozen
    855  f584							; while a drop-in/title/tally owns the player (DropTarget != 0) — otherwise
    856  f584							; the grace expires before he lands and the water death repeats.
    857  f584							; Runs on the FIRST TopGap line only: the next WSYNC absorbs its variable
    858  f584							; cycles, so the HUD band's line count and its cycle-tuned lines never move.
    859  f584		       a5 9c		      lda	Hover
